# Claude Code local configuration (machine-specific, not shared with the team)
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/local/
# A CLAUDE.local.md (or any CLAUDE.md) on the path stops Claude Code from reading
# AGENTS.md, unless /config sets project instructions to claude-md-and-agents-md (ADR-0022).
CLAUDE.local.md

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

